  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tonga Disaster Preparedness and Response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment covers Australia&#x2019;s support for Tonga&apos;s disaster?preparedness. It also covers responses to disasters, including Tropical Cyclone Ian in 2014, Tropical Cyclone Gita in 2018, the 2022 Hunga-Tonga Hunga-Ha&apos;apai volcanic eruption and tsunami, and the 2023 telecommunications ransomware attack. The investment includes funding to government (budget support) and NGOs to preposition supplies and deliver assistance post-disasters. The investment also includes deployment of specialists.</narrative>
  </description>
